  "Receipt link via the order reference (D86) was not probed: no receipt created, POST cap not used for it.",
  "Lost-response recovery for the purchase POST was not simulated; the lookup ran after the ack. No duplicate/replay test was run and none is authorized.",
  "One vendor, one row, quantity 1, price 12.345678, VAT 22, storage MB, one purchase numerator; multi-row rounding, other VAT codes and attribute combinations are unobserved.",
  "idBu, idNumerator, idVat, idStorage and material mappings are host configuration that this slice does not derive (the numerator query returns two numerators regardless of document type).",
